  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.5 targets Teamfight Manager 2 base 0.5.1 and keeps Yone's active contract Q/W/R. Spirit Cleave now scans one current GameCtx with no process-global ledger, hits each valid enemy once inside a true 80-degree, 42000-range cone, deals 35 + 45% Attack + 6% target maximum-health physical damage, and settles exactly one shield tier for zero through five champions hit. Mod API 0.8 cannot expose W-only attack-speed scaling, so cast time and cooldown are honestly fixed at 0.5 and 8 seconds. Retired E and 0.10.4 rectangular-W native names remain no-op load compatibility only: embedded saved skill trees are not migrated, and testing the new W requires a newly created 0.10.5 save. All visible Yone battle frames receive explicit final-1x face templates while preserving the native actor contract. Legacy base-0.5.0 client/server extensions and four Ban/Pick layout overrides remain disabled by default.",
